{"text": "Mind Rich CRM is described as the world's most easy to use CRM software.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "Srujal Patel is the creator of Mind Rich CRM.", "dimensions": ["team"], "type": "team_member", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "Srujal Patel has an electronics degree and a postgraduate degree in Management (MBA) from Canada.", "dimensions": ["team"], "type": "team_member", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "Srujal Patel has a diploma in Business System Analysis and Project Management from Canada.", "dimensions": ["team"], "type": "team_member", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "Srujal Patel has 12 years of experience in B2B sales operations.", "dimensions": ["team", "objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The funding goal for Mind Rich CRM was $4,731.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The funding period for Mind Rich CRM was from August 27, 2017, to September 26, 2017.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The project was unsuccessful in reaching its funding goal.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "Mind Rich CRM is targeted at small organizations that find existing software and ERP platforms complicated and costly.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "Srujal Patel developed Mind Rich CRM to provide an affordable and easy-to-use ERP solution.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The author has 12 years of experience in operations handling different portfolios.", "dimensions": ["team"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The author has encountered many complicated software and ERP platforms during their career.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The author developed an idea for an affordable and easy-to-use ERP system called Mind Rich CRM.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "innovation", "feasibility"], "type": "product", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "Mind Rich CRM is designed to be easy to use and affordable for small organizations.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "innovation", "feasibility"], "type": "product", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The author plans to develop additional modules for Mind Rich CRM, including HR, Accounting, and Material Management.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "innovation"], "type": "pipeline", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The author is seeking support through Kickstarter to develop the other modules of Mind Rich CRM.", "dimensions": ["strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "funding_source", "primary_dimension": "strategy", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "A demo version of Mind Rich CRM is available for users to try before backing the project.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The author aims to deliver the actual product of Mind Rich CRM in November 2017.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "feasibility"], "type": "milestone", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "Functional testing of Mind Rich CRM is currently ongoing.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "An Android app for Mind Rich CRM is also being developed.", "dimensions": ["innovation", "feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The author believes that technology is a basic need today and should be accessible to everyone.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The author emphasizes the importance of contributions to help bring the technology for all mission to life.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The development of an Android app is currently underway.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "Business software projects can be expensive and risky undertakings.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "A badly failed business software project can produce nothing of value at great expense.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The project will use a Minimum Viable Product approach to get real-world feedback early.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy"], "type": "pipeline", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "Identifying and addressing technical risks early is a strategy to reduce risk in the software development project.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy"], "type": "pipeline", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "Engaging users early and often in the project is a method to ensure a viable outcome.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "Users may describe what they are used to rather than what they really need.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "Small but loud minorities of users may skew results by raising undue concerns about particular issues.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "Contributions to the project can be made beyond monetary support.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "Sharing the campaign on social media platforms like Facebook and Twitter is another way to help.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt56__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
